<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Unidare says Culliton resigns as chairman.</title>
<headline>Unidare says Culliton resigns as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unidare Plc said on Friday that James Culliton had resigned as chairman and director of the company, effective from October 1.</p>
<p>Jack Hayes, who has been a director of the group since, 1990, has been elected to replace him, Unidare said in a statement.  </p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
